WEBVTT

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:03.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.000
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:08.800
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.520
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.520
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.940
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.940
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.150
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.150
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.370
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.370
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.430
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.100
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:58.100
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:00.470
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:00.470
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.020
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.020
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:17.160
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:17.160
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.290
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.460
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:52.630
Sonic!

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:57.470
Amy!

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:01.760
Will you dare attack me now, Sonic?

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:05.020
Let me go, you idiot!

00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:11.940
What are you doing, you perverted bird!

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:14.280
Amy, stay still!

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:16.490
Sonic!

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:20.780
Sonic, I have a ring!

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:22.120
Okay!

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:25.080
I got it!

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:39.680
What do you want?

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:50.020
You're safe now, Amy.

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:52.060
Sonic.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.500
Sonic, you're like the wind.

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:14.790
And I'm a flower petal swept away by the wind.

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:18.340
I know Sonic will sweep me away someday...

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:23.340
Weren't you listening?

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:24.890
To what?

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:33.480
How dare you play dumb!

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:36.320
What's wrong?

00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:42.090
Episode 24

00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:42.090
Wild Sonic! Strategic Capture Operation

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:57.420
Sheesh!

00:03:57.420 --> 00:04:01.300
You're the worst! You're horrible! I can't believe you!

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:03.930
Why are you angry, Amy?

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:06.300
Check out Sonic's attitude!

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:09.140
Did Sonic do something?

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:11.730
Why is he acting like that!

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:15.150
He's the same as usual.

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:18.980
You're wrong! He's acting like that to get on my nerves!

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:21.530
But he's only digging in his ears.

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:24.360
You guys will never understand!

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:45.630
He's gone.

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:49.050
He ran away because he felt uncomfortable!

00:04:49.050 --> 00:04:50.260
You think?

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:52.020
Of course!

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:56.940
I'm worried. Let's go after him in the X-Tornado.

00:04:57.190 --> 00:04:58.440
Okay.

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:13.370
Why won't my feet stop moving?

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:21.210
Sorry.

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:29.050
You're underestimating me if you think you can escape from 'The Gust of the Galaxy'.

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:31.140
Sonic!

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:37.770
I'll let you off today. I arrest people quickly, but I also free them quickly. Outta the way!

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:43.860
Just wait, Sonic!

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:58.670
My name is 'The Gust of the Galaxy'. I'm currently on a special mission, so move out of the way!

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:00.500
Oh my.

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:03.880
It's my uncle.

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:06.130
He's driving recklessly.

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:10.140
I have no other choice. Uncle, this is Chris.

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:13.140
Don't call me Uncle. I'm 'The Gust of the Galaxy'.

00:06:13.140 --> 00:06:16.520
If you have anything to say, say it quickly. I'm very busy right now.

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:19.230
How's Sonic doing?

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:22.480
He's fast, but I'll beat him today!

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:27.860
No, that's not what I meant. Besides I don't think you can ever beat Sonic.

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:31.530
Nothing is impossible for 'The Gust of the Galaxy'! Transmission over!

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:37.000
I think I provoked him.

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:43.420
I'm going to win!

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:48.720
Hey.

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:50.340
We've only just begun.

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:55.970
I'm out of gas?

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:05.070
I get involved quickly, but I also give up quickly.

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:15.490
Oops!

00:07:22.710 --> 00:07:23.880
Whoa!

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:30.470
It's too dangerous to stay in town.

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:40.270
He exited.

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:42.060
He's headed for the wasteland.

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:44.100
Something must've happened to him.

00:07:57.370 --> 00:07:59.080
Sonic.

00:08:07.090 --> 00:08:10.760
He sped up again. Why?

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:27.310
Something must have happened to Sonic's ear back then. That's why he's going berserk.

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:29.070
So what did happen?

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:31.190
I don't know.

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:35.910
Let's discuss with Grandpa and come up with a solution, Amy.

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:42.450
I'm sorry, Sonic. I thought you were acting this entire time.

00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:46.630
I'm going to save you.

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:02.100
Dr. Eggman, I'll put it up on screen.

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:08.610
Sonic is currently exercising.

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:13.940
I think you should exercise once in a while too, Dr. Eggman.

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:18.320
You dimwit! I have enough to do exercising my brain!

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:24.870
He really does have such annoying speed.

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:33.420
Is there anything we can do, Chuck?

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:38.430
The first thing we have to do is catch Sonic. But as for the method...

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:46.140
I have a good idea.

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:07.660
Where are you running, Sonic?

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:33.020
Our strategy is very simple and effective.

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:36.900
When the X-Tornado finds Sonic, we'll tail him.

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:42.070
When the timing is right, we shoot a special balloon bomb at Sonic.

00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:50.170
And that's how it will work. Begin Operation Balloon!

00:10:52.310 --> 00:10:55.820
<i>Operation Balloon</i>

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:05.510
I've been waiting for you.

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:07.060
I found Sonic.

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:10.310
Roger. Lead him to project headquarters.

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:11.730
Yes sir.

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:29.160
Here he comes.

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:34.170
Now!

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:40.300
Ouch!

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:41.590
All right!

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:50.060
Sonic!

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:53.690
Hey guys!

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:03.160
Chuck, enough already! Where is it taking me?

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:05.820
I may have put in too much gas.

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:21.380
Put me down! This is enough!

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:24.760
Somebody help! Help me!

00:12:24.760 --> 00:12:27.260
This is enough!

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:28.890
What is that?

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:32.350
Do something!

00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:47.660
Here's a gift for you.

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:50.200
Sonic?

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:59.170
I'm worried. Where did he go? What happened?

00:13:02.670 --> 00:13:05.800
Is something wrong with Sonic?

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:13.100
So all we have to do is stop Sonic.

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:14.730
But how?

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:16.190
With this.

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:19.150
I'm against violence!

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:22.320
Fine, then I won't use this.

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:24.530
Amy is scary.

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:31.450
You're all cranky because you're hungry. Let's eat.

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:41.340
Sonic is running with all his might. So I...

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:42.590
So I…

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:45.800
I will eat with all my might!

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:50.140
This is delicious.

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:53.770
Sonic must be hungry too.

00:13:53.970 --> 00:13:56.060
You're right.

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:03.360
Tails looks to be having fun.

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:08.570
That's it!

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:11.910
Knuckles waits on top of a hill.

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:15.290
When he gets the signal, he rolls a special cage down the hill.

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:18.960
Sonic arrives from the front and gets stuck in the cage.

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:21.250
I'm calling this Operation House Mouse!

00:14:23.230 --> 00:14:26.740
<i>Operation House Mouse</i>

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:38.940
Tanaka, send Knuckles the signal.

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:39.690
Right!

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:42.650
While you're doing that, I'm going to…

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:46.820
Now!

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:16.520
You did it, Grandpa!

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:18.310
Simple as pie.

00:15:21.060 --> 00:15:24.150
You must be hungry, Sonic.

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:28.440
Thanks.

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:40.910
Now that I'm full, I'm getting sleepy.

00:15:40.910 --> 00:15:42.920
Don't go to sleep, Sonic!

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:46.630
No, wait. It might stop him from running.

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:50.880
Go to sleep, Sonic. Would you like me to sing you a lullaby?

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:52.840
No thanks.

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:57.060
He has a new exercise machine.

00:15:57.060 --> 00:15:58.930
This calls for some action!

00:15:58.930 --> 00:16:00.100
Yeah!

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:01.810
Time for dessert.

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:04.900
Dr. Eggman, that's not fair!

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:13.110
Grandpa, the speed of the cage seems to be getting faster.

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:17.080
He's moving instinctively. I may have underestimated him.

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:20.450
Anyway, he seems to have his energy back.

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:27.000
This is bad! If this keeps up, it will keep rotating forever!

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:30.880
This is big trouble, Chuck!

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:50.570
Run for it!

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:54.240
Wow!

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:58.910
Looks like he woke up.

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:04.160
Isn't there anything else we can do, Chuck?

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:10.670
Just wait. My gray brain cells are starting to fire up quickly.

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:16.890
I have an idea!

00:17:20.890 --> 00:17:24.560
It will work this time.

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:34.990
Is Sonic testing his limits?

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:38.700
That means our battles will become tougher.

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:39.660
Alright!

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:42.740
I'm going to sleep so that I can be ready tomorrow.

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:44.790
Your eyes will rot from too much sleep!

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:46.920
Now I'm wide awake!

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:53.630
It's time.

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:19.240
'The Stranger of the Wasteland' has just arrived.

00:18:19.610 --> 00:18:22.240
Thanks for coming so early in the morning.

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:27.000
I go to bed early at night, so I also wake up early. It's no problem for me.

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:30.330
Okay, I'll explain the plan.

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:35.210
Today, we will use Sonic's competitive spirit to our advantage. First, 'The Gust of the Galaxy' will…

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:36.760
It's 'The Stranger of the Wasteland'!

00:18:36.760 --> 00:18:43.560
'The Stranger of the Wasteland' will wait for Sonic at the canyon and then challenge him to a race. The race course will be a straight line.

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:46.100
Ahead will be a trap.

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:52.230
If 'The Stranger of the Desert' passes through the second panel, Sonic will definitely head towards the first panel.

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:55.110
When Sonic passes through the panel...

00:18:55.610 --> 00:18:59.900
I name this Operation Sticky-Sticky!

00:19:01.930 --> 00:19:05.410
<i>Operation Sticky-Sticky</i>

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:08.000
The situation is heavy.

00:19:11.540 --> 00:19:13.750
He will enter the canyon soon.

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:16.800
Alright, I'm burning with passion!

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:21.010
Go!

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:35.480
What's wrong, Sonic? You're not acting like your usual self.

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:49.000
What do you think you're doing? You're just a decoy!

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:53.750
A decoy? You must be kidding! This is a battle between men!

00:19:58.300 --> 00:19:59.710
Not bad.

00:20:01.050 --> 00:20:02.840
He's almost near the trap.

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:06.970
Mr. Stranger of the Desert, make sure you don't go through the wrong panel.

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:09.390
Panel? Which panel was it again?

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:12.390
Go through panel number two!

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:15.860
Number two! Understand?

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:20.570
You think I'm number two? I'm number one!

00:20:22.150 --> 00:20:23.410
Aww geez.

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:39.090
We chose the wrong person to carry this out.

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:44.010
Chuck, there's something I'm worried about. There's static in the transmission.

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:46.390
Yes, I'm concerned about it too.

00:20:46.760 --> 00:20:51.930
I recorded the jamming pattern. Can you analyze it with your computer?

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:59.690
I found the source of the jamming signal.

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:02.240
It's from the ranch where we were before!

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:18.790
Tails, let's go!

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:20.460
Okay, Amy.

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:26.430
I found it. Hang on, Sonic.

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:50.830
Amy!

00:22:03.460 --> 00:22:05.550
Sonic!

00:22:10.350 --> 00:22:13.140
I was worried.

00:22:13.350 --> 00:22:15.100
Listen to me!

00:22:15.100 --> 00:22:17.560
There's something in here again.

00:22:23.110 --> 00:22:24.400
Ticklish!

00:22:24.440 --> 00:22:27.820
That was a bit hard, Amy.

00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:54.450
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:54.450
<i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i>

00:22:54.450 --> 00:23:03.420
<b>Ai suru to kime kisae namida ni ujirareteru</b>

00:22:54.450 --> 00:23:03.420
<i>The nervousness of love is sealed by tears.</i>

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:12.300
<b>Boy boy futari de jumon wo sagashi ni ikou</b>

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:12.300
<i>Boy, let’s search for a spell together,</i>

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:21.900
<b>Kinji rareta yume wo kanaerareru kuni he</b>

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:21.900
<i>To a land where our forbidden dreams can come true.</i>

00:23:22.770 --> 00:23:30.840
<b>Dare ni mo naisho de ashita na tchi awaseshiyou</b>

00:23:22.770 --> 00:23:30.840
<i>Let’s secretly meet tomorrow.</i>

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:41.040
<b>Itsuka kotori wo ume ta yowake no mieru oka de</b>

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:41.040
<i>At the place where we buried the bird, the hill where we can see the sunrise.</i>

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:49.800
<b>Tsumetai asamoya kimi to te wo tsunaidara</b>

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:49.800
<i>In the cold morning mist, if I hold hands with you.</i>

00:23:50.550 --> 00:23:58.970
<b>Hikaru michi no fuuin ga tokeru yo</b>

00:23:50.550 --> 00:23:58.970
<i>The seal to the shining path will be broken.</i>

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:03.810
<b>Hateshinaku</b>

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:03.810
<i>Forever...</i>

00:24:30.460 --> 00:25:35.360
The Last Chaos Emerald
